# Impeccable design-tool state. The directory is deliberately NOT ignored:
# .impeccable/config.json carries the detector waivers and the reasoning behind
# them, .impeccable/design.json is the DESIGN.md sidecar, and both are meant to
# travel with the repo. Only the machine-local files below are excluded — the
# cache and roots manifest hold absolute paths, and the session journals are
# scratch. (The plugin also writes these to .git/info/exclude, which does not
# survive a clone; this does.)
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
.impeccable/live/roots.json
.impeccable/live/sessions/
